.TH "LEAN" "1" "Oct 2026" "lean" "lean Manual"

.SH NAME
lean-import - Apply the profile remembered for this directory


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBlean import [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Workspace awareness: lean remembers which profile you last applied
in each project directory.

.PP
lean apply api-dev          # remembers cwd → api-dev
  cd ~/Projects/api
  lean import                 # suggests / applies api-dev

.PP
Use --yes to skip the confirmation prompt.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for import

.PP
\fB-y\fP, \fB--yes\fP[=false]
	Skip confirmation prompt


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBlean(1)\fP


